# What a build never needs, and what must never end up in an image: the local environment files first of all.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-demo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.vitest

# Tests, their support code and the end-to-end suites: nothing of them runs in production.
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
apps/server/test
apps/server/scripts
apps/web/e2e
apps/web/e2e-collab
apps/web/e2e-demo
apps/web/src/test

# The development seed is for development databases only and is never imported by the server.
apps/server/src/db/demo-seed

# Local instructions and the documentation: they are not part of a running system.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
docs
**/*.md
